</style>
<div class="wrap">
<h1>__NAME__ — milestones</h1>
<p class="stand">The order of work, and what each step <b>proves</b>. Generated from
<code>CLAUDE-checklist.md</code>'s <code>## Milestones</code> table — this page has no data of
its own, so it cannot drift from the plan. Click any node or title to open it.</p>
<div class="meters">
  <div class="m"><b>proven</b><span id="m1"></span></div>
